@base = http://localhost:8090
@token = opsflow-dev-token

### Dashboard numbers
GET {{base}}/api/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health of every service, waiting jobs, integrations, freezes
GET {{base}}/api/system
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry waiting jobs now
POST {{base}}/api/system/jobs/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Make the next deployment fail its health check
POST {{base}}/api/system/chaos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"failNext": 1}

### Freeze production
PUT {{base}}/api/system/freezes/production
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Festival change freeze"}

### Unfreeze production
DELETE {{base}}/api/system/freezes/production
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activity
GET {{base}}/api/activity/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/activity/deployments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/activity/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
